    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a concrete repair-related process execution or priority element to a textile failure mode that it addresses.</rdfs:comment>
