    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Assessment execution that gathers contextual evidence about repairability-related product aspects, services, guidance, design features, priority elements, costs, spare-part availability and user acceptance. It does not itself constitute the result.</rdfs:comment>
