    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Process involving preparation, cleaning, testing, servicing and, where necessary, repair to restore a textile product within its originally intended use and performance range.</rdfs:comment>
